<title>SPAIN: WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Water polo results on the</p>
<p>second day of the European swimming championships on Thursday:</p>
<p>Women:</p>
<p>Italy beat Portugal 17-0 (4-0 6-0 5-0 2-0)</p>
<p>Germany beat Czech Republic 8-4 (3-2 5-0 0-1 0-1)</p>
<p>Netherlands beat Russia 12-6 (6-1 2-1 2-2 2-2)</p>
</text>
